{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall do My statutes.</b> The matter of the sabbatical year and the Jubilee." "<b>And My ordinances you shall keep.</b> Regarding sale and purchase according to the count of the Jubilee year and otherwise, so that there be no fraud whatsoever." "<b>And you shall dwell in the land securely.</b> So that you not be exiled from it — the opposite of וְתִרֶץ אֶת שַׁבְּתוֹתֶיהָ בְּהָשַּׁמָּה מֵהֶם (Leviticus 26:34), and the opposite of בַּעֲוֹן בִּצְעוֹ קָצַפְתִּי (Isaiah 57:17)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:57.381887223Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}